\begin{itemize}
    \item zero dropped frames at 60 GB/s ingestion,
    \item tensor core utilization up to 99.2\%,
    \item Jacobian preservation down to $J = 0.005$,
    \item rendering latency maintained below 11 ms.
\end{itemize}

